{
    "title": "PDF Reader, All PDF Viewer",
    "description": "<b>PDF Go - Read, edit, share PDF easily! </b>\r\n\r\nPDF Reader app helps you read all PDF document files extremely quickly, manage PDF files professionally. This PDF file reader app allows you to open, search and read ebooks and documents right on your phone. Document zoom support, bookmarks and screen display options give you a perfect PDF reading experience.\r\nWhether you are a student, office worker or normal user, the application will help maximize work efficiency.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcd5 Convenient PDF reader:</b>\r\n- Open PDF files quickly\r\n- Search and display all PDF files\r\n- Customize viewing mode: vertical and horizontal\r\n- Move pages quickly, easily jump to a specific page number by entering the page number\r\n- Zoom in or out on the page when reading pdf\r\n- Search for a specific phrase on file\r\n- Support dark mode reading\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcd5 Easy PDF editor</b>\r\n- Annotate on PDF files\r\n- Highlight, underline and strikethrough phrases\r\n- Draw on PDF files\r\n- Search for a specific phrase\r\n- Select and copy phrases in PDF files.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcd5 Scan to PDF: </b>\r\n- -Scan any document and convert to PDF, scan your ID cards & Passport\r\n- Select and convert image to PDF\r\n- Powerful editing tool after scanning: Add filter, crop pages, and adjust scans\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcd5 Manage PDF:</b>\r\n- Organize and manage all PDF files in one place\r\n- Sort files by: name, file size, time...\r\n- Rename file\r\n- Delete PDF file\r\n- Share PDF\r\n\r\nReading and managing PDFs has never been easier. Experience the PDF Go application now to turn your smartphone into a great PDF library.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>PDF Go - Read, edit, share PDF easily! </b><br><br>PDF Reader app helps you read all PDF document files extremely quickly, manage PDF files professionally. This PDF file reader app allows you to open, search and read ebooks and documents right on your phone. Document zoom support, bookmarks and screen display options give you a perfect PDF reading experience.<br>Whether you are a student, office worker or normal user, the application will help maximize work efficiency.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcd5 Convenient PDF reader:</b><br>- Open PDF files quickly<br>- Search and display all PDF files<br>- Customize viewing mode: vertical and horizontal<br>- Move pages quickly, easily jump to a specific page number by entering the page number<br>- Zoom in or out on the page when reading pdf<br>- Search for a specific phrase on file<br>- Support dark mode reading<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcd5 Easy PDF editor</b><br>- Annotate on PDF files<br>- Highlight, underline and strikethrough phrases<br>- Draw on PDF files<br>- Search for a specific phrase<br>- Select and copy phrases in PDF files.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcd5 Scan to PDF: </b><br>- -Scan any document and convert to PDF, scan your ID cards &amp; Passport<br>- Select and convert image to PDF<br>- Powerful editing tool after scanning: Add filter, crop pages, and adjust scans<br><br><b>\ud83d\udcd5 Manage PDF:</b><br>- Organize and manage all PDF files in one place<br>- Sort files by: name, file size, time...<br>- Rename file<br>- Delete PDF file<br>- Share PDF<br><br>Reading and managing PDFs has never been easier. Experience the PDF Go application now to turn your smartphone into a great PDF library.",
